  "content": "Week 17: Overleaf\n\nWell, I found this editor that supports full Latex support and also can be hosted on a serf-service.\n\nThe original idea is to use it so that my supervisor can review my result with it. I tried to host it i=on a 8GB server. It can not fully support all the latex features. While the online service can, although it is not a free version as I have a such long thesis.\n\nEventually, I wrote my thesis with Latex locally, but the Overleaf editor is still a recommandation.",
